nt anatomical surface. This is not a patient registration, measured activation map, solved tissue PDE, or a forward ECG generator. Fitted-case CT surfaces use their original native field instead.","voltageScale":"Ventricular recovery shape comes from the imported pooled human optical template; absolute \u221285/+25 mV and a 2 ms intrinsic 10\u201390% upstroke are assumptions. Optical fluorescence did not measure these absolute voltages; scattering and filtering broaden the measured rise. Atrial shape is the imported Courtemanche model, not a measured atrial optical waveform.","measurementContext":"Relative optical fluorescence pooled from two isolated human LV endocardial wedge preparations. This is not an in-vivo whole-heart voltage recording. Local activation and APD fields are calibrated model outputs transferred to a different reference anatomy.","sources":[{"title":"Rodero et al. 2021 CT-derived population-average four-chamber anatomy","url":"https://zenodo.org/records/4593739","paper":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1008851","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"title":"Smirnov et al. 2020 human ventricular optical recordings","url":"https://zenodo.org/records/3986725","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"title":"Courtemanche et al. 1998 human atrial ionic model","url":"https://models.cellml.org/exposure/0e03bbe01606be5811691f9d5de10b65","license":"CC BY 3.0"},{"title":"Franz et al. 1987 human APD90 mapping","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/3802441/"},{"title":"Durrer et al. 1970 human activation","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/5482907/"},{"title":"Cranford et al. 2018 regional Purkinje-delivery sensitivity","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29549620/"}]}